ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Has estado en casa de {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}¡Está tan bien decorada que hasta
me dio envidia cuando la vi!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hast du das Haus von {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
gesehen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001D:}}Es ist äußerst reizend!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Da bekomme ich Lust, mein eigenes
Haus etwas umzugestalten.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Adesso hai una vera casa come
ogni cittadino che si rispetti!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Congratulazioni, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}You've added on to your home,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
haven't you?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} It looks great! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Do you
think you still need more space?{{TAG:0008:0005:190015001A002800}}
Yes, I will.
Nah, it's big enough.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hai ampliato casa tua,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} vero?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
È favolosa! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Pensi che avrai
bisogno di ancora più spazio?{{TAG:0008:0005:190015001A002800}}
Penso proprio di sì!
No, basta così.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du hast dein Heim erweitert!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Es sieht fantastisch aus!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wirst du
irgendwann noch weiter anbauen?{{TAG:0008:0005:190015001A002800}}
Ja, klar!
Nein, mir reicht es so.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}I didn't know your place was so
spacious! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Any chance I can store a
few thousand pairs of shoes there?{{TAG:0009:0001:1B001C001D00}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡No sabía que habías ampliado
tanto tu casa! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Si te sobra alguna
habitación, avísame.{{TAG:0009:0001:1B001C001D00}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Non sapevo che casa tua fosse
così spaziosa! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Non è che potrei
parcheggiare un po' di scarpe da te?{{TAG:0009:0001:1B001C001D00}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Dein Haus ist riesig!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Möchtest du
mir nicht ein Zimmer für meine
Bücherei zur Verfügung stellen?{{TAG:0009:0001:1B001C001D00}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Evinin bu kadar geniş olduğunu
bilmiyordum! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Birkaç bin çift ayakkabımı
orada saklasam olur mu?{{TAG:0009:0001:1B001C001D00}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Ich bin sehr erfreut, dass {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
nicht mehr in diesem winzig kleinen
Zelt wohnen muss!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} evini geliştirmek için
çok çalışıyormuş diye duydum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Söylentiye göre{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}} {{TAG:000E:0005:080068006500270073000A0073006800650027007300}}
birkaç duvarı bile yıkıp evi büyütmüş.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Da quando in qua {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
vive in una reggia del genere?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Me la ricordavo molto più piccola.
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Devo scoprire cosa ha escogitato
per potersi permettere una casa
così sontuosa!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Cosa faresti se perdessi uno
degli oggetti a te più cari?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Io sarei disperata!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Fortunatamente, {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
c'è la stazione di polizia {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}che
raccoglie tutti gli oggetti smarriti!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Sai di cosa avrei voglia adesso?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Di una bella tazza di caffè
bollente, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ho deciso: {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}vado subito a berne una.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Se mi cercano,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sono alla caffetteria
di {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Bartolo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}I've been meaning to ask you—{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}are you friends with the mayor of
{{TAG:0005:0006:}}?{{TAG:0008:0005:1E0000001F000000}}
Yes, we're friends.
We know each other.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Dime una cosa,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿eres amig{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
de la persona que trabaja aquí?{{TAG:0008:0005:1E0000001F000000}}
Sí, claro
Nos conocemos

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}uzun zamandır soracağım—{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0005:0006:}}
başkanıyla arkadaş mısın?{{TAG:0008:0005:1E0000001F000000}}
Evet, arkadaşız.
Tanışıyoruz.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Naturalmente, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}il prossimo passo
sarebbe aggiungere un altro piano.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Sì, dovresti farlo, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
